Awu
$cards
DECK 8 SPADES

$initial
DRAW 40 DEAL KIWE
KIWE 9 FACE_LAST
KIWE 4 FACE_LAST
KIWE 0 FACE_LAST
KIWE 5 FACE_LAST
KIWE 0 FACE_LAST
KIWE 0 FACE_LAST

COLUMN 10 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
COLUMN 4 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
COLUMN 9 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
COLUMN 4 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
COLUMN 10 FACE_HALF
